{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My husband's out looking for food, the kids are with me - we're waiting"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"I've got two boys and a daughter, they're hiding in the basement with a flashlight"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=careful",{"My family is none of your concern"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My wife passed in the spring, the grandkids are in Lexington, I think - I hope","Three kids, nine grandchildren, I haven't heard from any of them in days"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Not something I talk about with just anybody"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My sister's in Cincinnati, I try not to think about it - I try","Parents are in Florida, I hope they have a boat"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=careful",{"They're fine, they're somewhere else"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_loner|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had a brother once, haven't spoken in years, wish I had","There's a dog, that's about it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_loner|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Nobody, that's how I like it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife and two kids, they're at my sister's place, I'm trying to get to them","Brother works at the same plant, I haven't seen him since the whistle blew"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Family's safe, that's all you get"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_firefighter|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"The company is my family, fourteen guys and a dalmatian","My wife drove up to her mother's in Bowling Green - I pray she made it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_firefighter|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Not discussing it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_medical|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My husband's a deputy, I haven't heard his voice since Friday, I keep working","I have a daughter at her father's, I don't know if they're alive"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My congregation is my family, half of them are still with me","My wife is holding the church while I'm out, we trade off"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Pray for them, that's all I ask"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife and a boy, eight years old - they're out at my in-laws' farm - I hope"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"I put them in the car on the first night and told them to drive - I haven't heard since"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Why do you want to know about my family?"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Three daughters - Eldest is a nurse, I haven't been able to raise her on the radio","My wife passed years ago, my deputies are the only family I have left"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"That's personal - don't push it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife's a school teacher in Elizabethtown, I keep radioing - nobody answers"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Not relevant - move along"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Divorced, kid lives in Tennessee - I hope he's okay"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"That's personal, {g:pal|lady}"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"My team is my family now, the one back home I try not to think about"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"No"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Mom and a younger brother, hometown is in Ohio - I don't know if the roads are open"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fiancee, we were going to marry in the spring - she doesn't know I'm here"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=careful",{"Can't talk about it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife, two daughters, in base housing at Knox, I haven't been able to reach them","Divorced twice, my unit is the closest I've got"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"That's classified - move along"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Left a daughter behind, she'd be nine now, I'm hoping she's alive"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"No family, don't ask again"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=elite_operator,elite_delta,mercenary|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's a sister, we haven't spoken in years"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"My mama's in Evansville, if she's alive, she's cursing my name","Had a girl once, she got tired of waiting"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I've got none"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Got a crew, that's the only family you need","Dead, all of them, that's how it works"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"Why? You looking to send flowers?"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=gang_member,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"My crew's my family, we eat together, we bleed together","Moms in the projects, haven't seen her since the TV said stay inside"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"The club's family, brothers who'd take a bullet for you","Old lady's back at the clubhouse, if she's alive"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=careful",{"Club's my family - leave it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"The organization is my family, that's what we call it","A wife - two kids, in a place nobody knows about"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I don't talk family with strangers"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody wrote to me inside, nobody's waiting out here","Daughter in Dayton, hasn't seen me since she was three"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"No family, they got tired of me"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My wife and my girl, they're- I don't know where they are, okay? I don't KNOW","Mom's in Louisville... I tried and tried to get through -- nothing, just that awful busy signal","I've got a brother in Brandenburg, if he's- no, he's fine, he's FINE, he's stubborn as a mule","Not out here... my sister's at her husband's folks -- she's okay, she has to be okay","Yes... a husband, two boys, and I'm going to get back to them if it's the last thing I do","No family, just a cat, and I left her with the neighbor, so I guess I don't even have a cat","Parents, both of 'em, still in the old house on Elm, I keep going to go get 'em and keep chickening out","I have a daughter... she's six, she's with her dad, they were supposed to be at the lake, God please","Just my dad, it's always been just my dad, and he wouldn't leave the house, he's too stubborn, I tried","My boyfriend's out there somewhere, we got split up at the gas station, I keep thinking he'll just- walk up","Y-yeah, a big one, three sisters, two brothers, and I'm the only one I can't reach, which is a first","I don't wanna jinx it... so, uh, yes, yes I do, and they're fine, and that's ALL I'm gonna say","A mother, she's in a nursing home, and NOBODY's picking up, and nobody's going to pick up, are they","Out here? God, no, I'd never- if they were out here I'd be a mess, they're at my aunt's, far from all this","No, no one, my folks passed years back and, well, it's just been me, so this isn't as different as it should be"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,4",{"My wife was at work when it started, I tried the phone for hours, I keep trying","I saw my mom on Friday for lunch, FRIDAY, she was fine, she's gotta be fine","I left my kids with their grandmother, two days ago, she's got a gun, she's tough, she'll be fine","My husband went to work Thursday... nothing since, and don't say it, I know what you're thinking"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife and son, buried them myself, back of the churchyard, I don't have anybody left to write to","Had a sister, tried to reach her, that was... a while ago, she's gone, I'm pretty sure","I've got a husband, he's alive, we wave to each other when the radio works, it's something","My folks are in Florida, thank God, as far from here as you can get","Had a family, had one, I'm not going to do the thing where I cry in front of you, okay","Two daughters, they're with my ex, in Indiana, I think, I hope, the roads are closed so I just- hope","My son, he's seventeen, he's with a group out west of here, I see him every other week, it's about all I've got","I don't have one anymore, I've got these people, and that's... that's enough, that's got to be enough","Brother... we're traveling together, he's a pain, I wouldn't trade him"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly",{"You're sweet to ask, family's all I think about, my husband, my two girls, you have no idea","Honestly, nobody's asked me anything real in days... yes, I got a wife, she's waiting","Aw, hey, that's kind, yeah, I've got my kids, that's why I'm still fighting","My mom and dad. My little brother, too. I can't think about one without thinking about the others"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"Why are you asking about my family? I don't like that question","That's none of your business, and don't ask me again","I'm not telling a stranger who I've got waiting, forget it","Keep my family out of your mouth, okay?"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_loner",{"Used to have, divorced fifteen years, one boy somewhere in Ohio, haven't talked in a long time","Me and a hound named Duke, that's all the family I need","Brother up the holler, we don't speak, but I wonder if he's still breathing","Wife passed in '88, no kids, I'm used to the quiet, didn't think it'd get loud","A daughter in Lexington, I hope she's behind a locked door, I'd go if I thought I could make it","Nobody... and I'll tell you what, nobody to lose is a kind of lucky I'd never have wished on myself","Got a sister, we write at Christmas, I guess there won't be a Christmas card this year","Mother's in the ground, father too, I'm the last, there's nobody to call","Grown boys, both in the service, don't know where, I try not to think about it, that's how I keep going","Just the one cousin, and I haven't seen him since the funeral, so, no, not really","I've got a woman in town, we weren't married, so I don't know what to call her now, but I'm going back for her","Family's whoever's still standing next to me, and right now that's you, so, hi"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"No, nobody, and don't ask again","Family's for people who can afford the worry -- keep walking","None of your concern, friend!","I had one, past tense, and it ain't a long story, so don't ask for it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Yes, I've got kids, three, and that's why I'm not going to take chances with you, not yet","My wife's back at the house with the little ones, I'm out here getting what we need, that's why I'm a little jumpy","It's me, my husband, and the baby, he's eleven months, he's never going to remember any of this","Two girls and a boy, ages nine, seven, and four, and I'm lying to them every single hour of the day","My boy's fourteen... he thinks he's grown, he's not, he's still a baby, he needs me","My wife is pregnant, due in September, September, and I'm out here, so, you understand, I can't die","We're all together, the whole family, all eleven of us in one house, don't ask how we eat","Mother-in-law, wife, two kids, and a dog that doesn't like anybody, it's a full house","Yeah, I've got a wife, and God help me, she's the strong one, she's the one keeping us alive","My little brother and I are all that's left... he's in the other room -- he doesn't talk anymore","Husband's a deputy, I haven't seen him since Friday, he said he'd be back by supper","I'm a single mom, one kid, ten years old, he thinks I'm brave, that's what keeps me brave"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly",{"You want to see a picture? sorry, silly, I've got one in my wallet, it's the three of us at the county fair","Yeah, my whole family's right nearby, I can't tell you where, but they're safe, thank God, they're safe","Kids and a wife and a grandma, we all stick together, you're welcome to say hello sometime"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_man,family_woman|st=careful",{"That's none of your business and I want you to take a step back","Don't ask me about my kids, ever, don't even say the word","You asking where they are? is that what you're doing?","My family's none of your concern, and you'd better not make it your concern"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder",{"Four kids and eleven grandkids, and I can't get hold of a single one of 'em, you try that sometime","My Harold passed in the spring... thank the Lord he missed this, I'm gladder for that than I can say..","A daughter in Frankfort, I've called and called, I'd walk if I could, but I can't, not with these hips","Buried my wife in '84, my boy in the Gulf, I don't have anybody to worry about, which is the worst part","The church is my family now, those that's left, we keep each other fed","I've got a granddaughter, she's twenty, she came to me Thursday, thank God she did, thank God","Just my sister, eighty-four, tough as a boot, I know she's still alive, she'd never let a thing like this beat her","They put me in a home for a year, and then this happened, so my family got there before me, I reckon","Had a house full once, now I've got a cat, I'm used to it","Most of 'em are gone, yes, the ones I loved most are gone, I'm still standing, don't ask me why","My great-grandbaby was born Tuesday, TUESDAY, think about that, she's seven days old, God help her"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"I don't discuss my family with strangers, thank you","Why, so you can use 'em against me? no","That's mine, honey, and it's staying mine","Family's private!"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_youth",{"Mom and Dad are at home, I'm sure they are, they wouldn't go anywhere without me, they wouldn't","I've got a little sister, she's seven, she's asleep right now, don't wake her, please","My dad told me to run and not look back, and I did, and I hate that I did","Mom's a nurse... she was on shift, I haven't seen her, I keep thinking she'll just be at the door","Brother's in the Army, and I keep thinking, they're gonna send him here, and then I don't think","I live with my grandma, she's the toughest person I know, she'd beat these things with a spoon","Dad's a trucker, he's, like, somewhere in Tennessee, and he's gonna be SO mad if I'm not home","My whole family went to the lake for the Fourth, I stayed because of a stupid job, a STUPID JOB","It's just me and my cousin, her parents split, mine are... I don't know, I don't know where mine are","I've got two moms, and they are gonna be so loud when I get home, loud and crying, and I can't wait","Everybody, I mean everybody, aunts, uncles, cousins, I come from a big dumb loud family, and I miss the noise"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"Why? what do you want with my family?","Not telling you, sorry, it's just- no","I'm not stupid, I'm not telling you where anybody is","Not telling"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=worker",{"Wife and two boys, the older one wants to be a mechanic like me, he's fifteen, I told him go to college","Divorced, one daughter in Evansville, she's got her mother's temper, I hope she uses it","Just me and my truck... no wife -- no kids, folks'd say that's sad, I used to say it was efficient","Mother, in the home on Pike, she doesn't know what day it is anyway, maybe that's a blessing, I don't know","My wife works at the school, she's got a roomful of kids, so I know she's not alone, that's all I know","The guys at the plant are my family, nine of us, we eat together, we're all that's left","Girlfriend... we've been together six years, I was gonna ask her this fall, I had the ring, I still have the ring","Two kids, a wife, and a mortgage, I'm tired of being the only one who knows how bad it is","Brother's a cop, so he's either a hero or he's, uh, I can't finish that","Three daughters and a wife... and the amount of hair spray in my house you wouldn't believe, God, I miss it.."}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=worker|st=careful",{"My family's my business, and I'd like to keep it that way","Why should I tell you, {mister}, what's it to you?","I'm not talking about them, drop it!!"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_medical",{"Husband and two teenagers, they're at home, I told them to stay inside, lock the door, I told them","My mother's in assisted living, which means she's among the first, and I can't think about it, I can't","Single, no kids, I have my patients, I mean I HAD, I had my patients, God","A twin sister, she's an ER nurse in Louisville, and I haven't heard a thing, and I keep telling myself it's fine","I've got a wife, she's a teacher, she's got eight kids at her house right now, eight, can you believe it","My kids are with their dad, he's fifty miles away, and I want to go to them, and I can't, there's people here","Mom and Dad, and a little brother with Down syndrome, I need to get to them, and I'm trying, I'm trying","My husband's a doctor too, we were on the same shift, I lost sight of him in the lobby, I... let's not","I have a daughter -- Lily, she's five, I wake up saying her name"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I can't say, people come to me when they know my family","Why do you want to know? I'm sorry, I have to ask","That's private, wound or no wound, I won't tell you that","My family's off the table, I'm sorry, it's too much"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_clergy",{"I'm a widower... my congregation's what I have left, forty souls, I've buried six of them this week","Two grown daughters, one in Cincinnati, one in Nashville, they know how to reach the church, I pray they try","My wife's with the children at home... I'm out here with the stranded, God forgive me for leaving her..","Sister's a nun in Kentucky, somewhere near Bardstown, I keep thinking, well, if prayer works anywhere","Family? The whole parish, and my mother, who's ninety and can't see why I'm missing Sunday dinner","My husband's a deacon, he's with the women and children, I'm here, I check in, he's... he's trying","No blood family, but the choir, God, the choir, they're my children, my wonderful loud children"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"That is between me and the Lord, I'm sorry","Why do you ask? I don't discuss them"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Wife and two boys at the house, we drilled it, they know where to go, I just hope they remember","Single, but my crew is family, six guys, we eat, sleep, and argue, and I'd die for any one of them","My mother's in a nursing home across the county, I couldn't get to her, and that's the thing that'll kill me","Girlfriend, six months in, she was just starting to like me, you know what I mean, I wish I'd told her","Two kids with their mom, I'm on shift so many hours they barely know me, I want to fix that","Dad's a retired chief, he's tough, he's at home, with a shotgun and a lawn chair, he's fine","I've got a brother on another company, and I keep waiting for his engine to come around the corner"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"Leave my family out of it","Why? you want to know who to threaten?"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=militia",{"Wife and three boys -- back at the house, I check on 'em every day, they don't like how I look when I come home","Just me and the old man, he's up the ridge, he doesn't talk, but I know he's alright","A wife, a mortgage, a little girl who thinks I'm a war hero, I never fired a shot in anger until this week","I've got a sister, she's a deputy, you want to cross the wrong lawman's family, you'll know it","Mom... Dad, and a grandfather who fought in Korea and taught me everything worth knowing"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=militia|st=careful",{"My family stays out of this, and so do you!","Why do you want to know? family's off the table"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You asked about my people, huh? nobody's done that in so long, thank you, really, thank you!!","Come sit a minute, you actually care, I can tell, you're not just making noise!!","Yes, I've got folks, and I'd like to tell you about them, if you've got a minute!","I trust you with this, which is not a thing I say, I've got people I'm waiting for, I'll tell you all about 'em","You're one of the good ones, I can tell, you want to hear it, I've got a lot to say about my family","You really want to hear about them? nobody asks like you do, sit with me","I've got my daughter and her little boy, they think the world of you, they asked about you just yesterday","My husband's out there, and I tell myself he's thinking of me, and then I tell myself I'm not crazy","You remind me of my brother, he'd have liked you, he'd have argued with you over a card game","I had three boys, and I'd have been proud if one of them turned out like you!!","Just my mother now, and she's the toughest woman alive, she'd bake you a pie if she could","I'll tell you because I trust you: my wife is pregnant, due in the fall, and I haven't told anyone else","My dad's the reason I'm still here, he taught me everything, and I miss his voice","It's a big loud family, thirteen of us, and I'd give anything to hear them argue about nothing","I have a sister who'd adore you, she collects strays, human and otherwise","My folks are in the next county, I hope, I pray, and sometimes I whisper to the wall","I had a husband, a good one, and I carry his Zippo in my pocket, it still sparks","Mary and Jake, my kids, I haven't seen either since we got separated","My kids are the reason I keep my head, they depend on me, you know","My grandmother raised me, and she'd have given you the shirt off her back!!","Two boys, a wife, and a mongrel, quite the menagerie","There's my mom, my stepdad, and a half-brother who can't stop talking","You're the first stranger I've told, and I don't regret it","My family's scattered like seed, but I believe some of it will take root!","We lost one, we kept the rest, and we're in debt to people like you","Family, for me, is whoever stays, and you stayed","I've got a son in the Army, he writes, or he did, I keep the letters","A little girl, six years old, drawing pictures of horses, ha","My brother's in the next room, snoring, and it's the best sound I know","I come from a long line of stubborn, hard-working fools, and I wouldn't change a thing!","My spouse and I are celebrating twelve years next month, in a cellar, with a candle","The ones I love live in my pocket, in pictures, in notes, in small things, ha","It's just me and my cat now, but she's family, and she likes you","Kinfolk, all over the county, and every one of them would feed you"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Not talking about my family with you, not after what I heard","Why would I tell YOU anything about my people, after the way you've acted?","You've got some nerve asking"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|rep=bad,worst",{"Back off, I'm not discussing my family with you!!","Don't you dare ask about my kids, I know what you are","Never mind my family, stay away from them, understand me?"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"My family, they're- I don't know, I don't know where they are, I can't think about it, I can't","Please don't ask me that, please, every time I think of them, I can't breathe","I have a husband... and a daughter, and I don't know if they're ALIVE, and it's tearing me apart","I'm all alone NOW -- and it's the scariest thing I've ever felt, being alone like this","I don't know where my husband is","My mom lives alone","I left my daughter with my mother-in-law"},false,false,{[5]={{t="I've called out the window... I've walked the streets, I've asked everyone",afterMs=3500},{t="please, if you see him, he's tall, he wears a green cap",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="she doesn't have a car, she doesn't have a phone that works",afterMs=3500},{t="I need to get to her, I need to",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="I should've taken her",afterMs=3500},{t="I should've taken her with me",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"Family was a long time ago... now it's the people who stay","I had one... I buried it, I don't discuss it, it's easier that way","Two kids and a wife, in the ground, near the oak tree, that's my family","We're all each other has, so yeah, family, that's what we are","Had a wife... had a son, I put them in the ground myself","I've learned not to think about them","I don't count the dead... I count the living"},false,false,{[5]={{t="next question",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="it works about half the time",afterMs=3500}},[7]={{t="there's two of us left, my sister and me..",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"My wife... my wife was the best... she'd have loved you... she'd have fed you...","Both my parents, in one week, in the same bed, holding hands, it was almost peaceful","I had a brother... he sang in the choir, I can still hear him, flat on the high note","A baby girl, she'd have been two in September... I keep her blanket... I keep it","I lost my wife, and my daughter, both on the same day...","My husband went out for cigarettes on Friday","Two boys, nine and twelve","Mama's in the ground, out back, by the apple tree..","My brother and I got separated in the dark","I had a little girl, Lily, she was five","Both my parents were in the nursing home","My sister says she'll meet me at the lake house","My husband was bitten defending the kids","I have a son, in the Army","There were six of us when this started","My baby's blanket is still in my pack","I had a- I have a- ...had.. have.. I don't know the word anymore","My wife.. my wife is- fuck- I can't, I can't, I can't say it","Two kids.. two beautiful kids.. and I.. I.. ha.. ha.. I'm sorry","I'm fine, I'm FINE, don't look at me like that, I'm fine","They- they were.. they are.. no... were... WERE... god damn it","My mom used to say- oh, hell, I can't do this"},false,false,{[5]={{t="please, let me go my way, okay?",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="I'm still holding the lighter he left",afterMs=3500},{t="he quit in March",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="the twelve-year-old held the door shut",afterMs=3200},{t="I won't say more",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="I dug it myself",afterMs=3500},{t="it took all day, and she'd have said I did it crooked",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="I called his name till I lost my voice",afterMs=3500},{t="now I call it in my head",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="I say her name every night",afterMs=3500},{t="out loud, doesn't matter who hears",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="I never made it to them",afterMs=3500},{t="I'll carry that one a long time",afterMs=3200}},[12]={{t="she doesn't know I'm not coming..",afterMs=3500},{t="or maybe she does",afterMs=3000}},[13]={{t="he made me promise, and I kept the promise",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't talk about how",afterMs=3200}},[14]={{t="no one will tell me where",afterMs=3500},{t="I write him letters, in my head",afterMs=3200}},[15]={{t="it's just me now",afterMs=3200},{t="I count the chairs",afterMs=2800}},[16]={{t="it smells like her",afterMs=3500},{t="I refuse to wash it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"My family's gone because some bureaucrat sat on a report, and I will never forget it","They took my kids, the Army took my kids, \"for their safety,\" and I haven't seen them since","Don't ask me about my family unless you plan to help me find them, God damn it","My family's scattered because some idiot closed the road at the wrong time","They took my kids, the soldiers, \"for processing\"","Don't ask me about my husband, he ran, he left us!"},false,false,{[4]={{t="I'll never forgive them!",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="that was Sunday",afterMs=3500},{t="I've been walking ever since",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="I hope he's happy",afterMs=3500},{t="I hope he's alive",afterMs=3000},{t="God, I hope he's alive",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I've got my sister, and my two nephews, and I'd love for you to meet them!","My wife is the strongest person I know, and she's waiting at home, with a lamp lit"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"I've got a husband who snores, a mother-in-law who criticizes, and a dog who steals socks, I love 'em all, heh","Family? A bunch of loud, stubborn, hot-tempered people, and I'd give a kidney to hear them argue","Family? A husband who snores, three kids who argue, a mother-in-law who inspects my dusting","My brother-in-law is the dumbest man alive, and the most loyal, ha","I come from a family of eleven, you ever try to be quiet with eleven"},false,false,{[3]={{t="I'd give anything to be inspected",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="if he's out there, he's probably fine, he's too dumb to die",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="that's why I'm good at this",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|mood=fear",{"Don't ask about my family","Leave my family out of this, back off"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"My husband's a doctor, too, we were on shift, I last saw him in the hall, he waved","Two kids, eight and five, at my mother's... I haven't heard a thing since Friday","Not here, but I think about them when I take my gloves off, like a punch","My mom is eighty-three, in a care facility, and I know exactly what's happened there"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=warm",{"I have a granddaughter, Josie, nine years old, and she wants to be a veterinarian","My husband and I will be married thirty years in October","Three kids, all grown and scattered - they call the church collect every Sunday and leave me a message","My mother's got a voice like gravel, and a heart like a pillow","My sister and I have a signal, two flashes of a lantern from her roof, and two back from mine!","My twin brother can't cook, can't fix anything, can't sit still"},false,false,{[1]={{t="she's in a basement three streets over, drawing dogs",afterMs=3200},{t="I check on her every sunset",afterMs=2800}},[2]={{t="he said we'll celebrate if we have to do it in a cellar!",afterMs=3200},{t="I believe him",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="it's the best sermon I hear",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="she's up in Indiana, and she's fine, I know she's fine, she's too stubborn to die",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="every night",afterMs=3500},{t="every night we do it",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="and I love him more than my own life",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"My family's my business","Why? you want to find them? you stay away from them!","Keep them out of this","They're fine!","Why?","That's none of your business, stranger - keep your hands where I can see them"},false,false,{[3]={{t="I'm serious",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="and they're none of your business",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="what's it to you, my family?",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=4,11",{"Funny you ask, I was thinking about them this morning, all of them, each face"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"My family is not your concern!","You'd go after them, wouldn't you? I know about you","Don't ask about them -- I'll ask you to leave","I won't speak of my people with you","They're safe -- and they'll stay that way, away from you!","Keep your eyes off my kids","After what you did to the Wallaces? never","My family has nothing to say to you","You want a name? Here's one: stay away","I have people who'd tear you apart if you came near","My family knows about you, and they'd rather not meet","I've seen what you do to families","Stay away from them, I'm warning you","None of your damn business","Why? so you can find them?","You've done enough harm to mine!","I'm not discussing them, not with you","Ask your own family -- if you have one!","Family, ha, as if you cared","Don't pretend to be interested","Not a word about them, not a single word","They're better off without you knowing them","You don't deserve to know","Move along, and leave my people out of it","They've heard of you, and they hide","Never mention them again!!","I'd have to be crazy to tell you anything","Where is my family? Safe from you","I don't like where this is going","The less you know, the safer they are","Leave them alone"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Not now, not now, I'll cry if I think of them, and crying makes noise","They're at home, they're safe, I need to get back, but THEY'RE in the way","My family needs me alive, so I'm hiding, hush","Ask me when it's quiet, when I can think","I can't talk about them while those things are around","They're safe, they have to be, shh, shh"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"My family would feel safer with someone like you around","I've got kids, and a spouse, and a lot of respect for what you're carrying"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"My husband passed in the spring","I had six children"},false,false,{[1]={{t="my daughter's in Ohio",afterMs=3500},{t="my grandson's in the Army",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="four left, I think",afterMs=3200},{t="I count the cards",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mom and Dad... and my little brother","It's just me and my sister"},false,false,{[1]={{t="they're at home, I think",afterMs=3500},{t="I hope",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="our parents were away",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"I've been trying to reach them since Friday","I keep thinking they'll walk up any minute","Three days, and not a word"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the phone just rings",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="I'm trying not to panic",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"I've given up expecting a call","A week, now, and I still look at every face"},false,false,{[1]={{t="now I just hope",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"It's been weeks","I say their names at dusk"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I've made peace with not knowing",afterMs=3500},{t="mostly",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="that's my ritual",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Family? Ha! Mine's the people standing next to me, the rest are dead or worse","Had one... don't anymore, and I'm not talking about it","My old man taught me everything I know, mostly how to take","Got a mother somewhere, haven't spoken to her in years"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"What's it to you? You gonna use them against me?!","Leave my family out of this or I'll leave yours out of everything"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Yeah, a sister in {town}, I'm worried sick about her, you?","Wife and two kids, I don't know where they are, can't stop thinking about it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"My crew's my family, blood don't mean much","My mama's back on the block, she'd kill me if she saw me now","Brother's inside, he's... I don't know where he is"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You ask about my family again and I'll make yours cry"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Little sister, she's fifteen, I'm trying to find her"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"The brothers are my family now, the club took me in when nobody else did","Ex-wife, two kids, they don't talk to me, can't blame them"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Don't ask about my blood, it'll end badly"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Got a daughter, she's twelve, I think about her every day"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"My family is... complicated","I prefer to keep that private","A sister, a cousin or two, nothing more"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Wife and a son, I just want them safe"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Yeah, I had a-- I had a wife, she stopped writing, I don't know","Mother, I think, probably dead, they wouldn't tell me anything"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't you talk about my family!"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"A little girl, she's seven, I haven't seen her in three years"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Dad's gone, mom's gone, brother went to the city, I don't know","Just me, always just me"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"A brother in Elizabethtown, I'm trying to reach him"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"A mother in Ohio, I'm hoping she's alive"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Wife and two daughters, I haven't seen them in days","My mother's in a nursing home, I don't know what happened to her"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=law|st=hostile",{"My family is not part of this conversation"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Wife, two boys, they're sheltering with her sister, I hope"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"My wife passed years ago, my daughter's a nurse in Louisville, I've been trying to reach her"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_trooper|st=neutral,careful",{"Wife, a baby on the way, if she's still alive, God help us"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_corrections|st=neutral,careful",{"Ex-wife, a teenage son, and I don't know where either of them are"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Parents in Texas, a younger brother, I haven't been able to call","A wife in Georgia, I can't reach her"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That is personal information"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Mom and my sisters, I miss them like crazy"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"My mom, she's gonna worry so much, she doesn't even know where I am"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No comment, and I mean it"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Wife, two sons, one still in diapers, they're why I'm out here","A whole farm of cousins, but nobody's answering"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Yes, a big family, thank God they're all with me"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","st=friendly,neutral",{"That's a bigger question than it sounds. Can we take it slowly?","I don't have news I'd trust. I try not to turn that into an answer","I'd rather tell you what they were like than guess where they are","I miss being annoyed by somebody who knew me that well","Some days I remember the little things first. Then the rest catches up","I haven't worked out how to tell that story without stopping halfway through","I don't want sympathy right this second. Company would be all right"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I've got people I think about. I don't always want to name them out loud"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","st=neutral,careful",{"I can talk about them. Just don't tell me you know how it feels","That's private. I'm not angry you asked, but that's my answer"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,civilian_man|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I lost my wife, they got her, my daughter as well - please, let me go my way... okay?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|role=family_woman,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,door",{"My husband drove to the pharmacy in Muldraugh on Saturday for my insulin - truck's not back, I leave the door unlocked"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mama's in a nursing home in Louisville, I called eleven times before the phones went dead, nobody picked up, not once","My folks live out past Ekron, I keep telling myself they had the sense to stay put - Mama always had sense"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"It's just me and my brother now, he's asleep behind that car, keep it down, he hasn't slept since Tuesday"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,civilian_man|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My wife's name is Darlene, red hair, teller at the bank in {town} - if you run across her, would you tell her I went to her sister's?"},false,{[1]="HELP_THEM"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,family_woman,civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Our boy was at church camp up by Brandenburg when it started - I'm walking there - please don't try to stop me"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=family|role=family_youth|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mom and Dad were at the house in Riverside, I was at a friend's, I haven't gone back to look - I'm not ready to look"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had a wife and two boys, buried the wife - boys headed for Fort Knox and I ain't heard since - ain't nobody else to tell you about","Family's whoever's still standing next to me come morning, right now that's a hound dog and a fella named Ray"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"Took my sister's kids when she turned, they still call me Aunt Bev like nothing changed, so that's something"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|world=road",{"Why? What do you want with my family? Ask your questions from that side of the road"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"You don't get to ask about my family, you get to turn around and walk"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|sex=m",{"Wife works dispatch at the fire station in Rosewood, last I heard on the radio she was still at her desk - that's where I'm going"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f|world=door",{"Husband's on second shift at the plant, I keep his lunch pail by the door so he knows I'm still here"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Got a crew, if that counts, six of us from the lumber yard - four now, we still eat lunch together at noon, out of habit"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"My family's the folks sleeping in the fellowship hall tonight - forty-one of them, I know every name, I made sure"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wife and kids went up to her mother's in Indiana the week before - best thing she ever did was not listen to me","The department was my family, near enough, we were eleven deputies on the ninth - we're three"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not discussing my family with you - step back and state your business"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My mom's in Ohio, she thinks I'm at Fort Knox doing paperwork, I guess I kind of am, paperwork with a rifle"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Unit's my family out here, the ones back home get letters I can't mail, writing them keeps my head straight"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative - next question"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Keep moving, my family's not your concern, and yours isn't mine"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had a cousin ran shine with me out past Irvington - they got him in his own still house, drunk and bit, hell of a way"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral|sex=m",{"My old lady took the kids and the station wagon in April - guess she was smarter than all of us"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider,gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Family? The boys I ride with, the rest of my blood can rot - most of 'em already are"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mama said I'd end up dead or in jail, did the jail part - now the whole county's dead, she got it half right"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"You fishing for something? Ask me about family one more time and see what it gets you"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Got a family? Good - think about 'em real hard while you walk away from me"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=hostile",{"Why, you wanna visit 'em? They're in a ditch off 31W - go on, tell 'em I said hi"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My mother's in Brandenburg, or she was, that's the extent of what I know"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=warm|world=building",{"All of us are in this house - every one, I count 'em in the night sometimes"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|mood=grim|world=vehicle",{"Wife's people were in Louisville, we don't talk about Louisville in this truck"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"My sister and her two, they're at the church with me - that's more than most"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=family_elder|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"I buried my Earl in 1987, first time in my life I've been glad about it..."}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"My daughter's a nurse in Lexington, I'd give this county to know that's still true"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Family's a letter I can't send, that's what the word means right now"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=sad",{"Don't, please, I'll talk about anything else you want - anything else"}},
{"ASK_FAMILY","reg=raider,gang,club|tmp=predator|st=hostile,neutral",{"Family? Yeah, these four ugly fellas right here - we picked each other"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Farms? There are farms, a few, out past the highway, but they're guarded, don't just walk up","My uncle has a farm, cattle and corn, he's got a shotgun and a bad attitude","I'd try, but I don't know how to farm, I don't even have a plant, I killed my cactus","Can we grow food? In the middle of this? I want to say yes, but I'm too tired to hope!","A garden, a little one, tomatoes, beans, we're trying, the rabbits keep eating it"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"We've got a plot out back, potatoes, onions, beans, it's slow, but it's food","Farms are the future, if there is one, because canned goods run out, and soil doesn't","Folks with land and a well are kings now... just saying","Plant now, harvest in the fall, and pray the frost holds off","Seeds are hard to find, and harder to keep, guard them like gold"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come help us tend the garden, we can always use hands, and there's always something to share"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"What I grow is my own business","Go farm somewhere else"}},
{"ASK_FARM","role=civilian_loner",{"Hunting beats farming -- but I keep a few rows of corn, in case"}},
{"ASK_FARM","role=family_man,family_woman",{"We've been farmers for four generations, and we're not stopping now"}},
{"ASK_FARM","role=family_elder",{"My late husband's garden, honey, still produces, tomatoes like softballs"}},
{"ASK_FARM","role=worker",{"Plant's got a greenhouse, half-broken, but a few tomatoes survived"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Farms? Sure, plenty of them, and plenty of people guarding them with shotguns","Growing food? Ha! You can barely keep yourself alive and you want to plant corn?","Farms were my favorite targets, full pantries, fat livestock, scared families","There's a dairy up the road, cows are gone, but the silo's full, if you can get past the dogs","Seeds are worth more than gold, if you find any, don't tell anyone"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Farms are mine, so back off!"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I grew up on a farm, honestly, I miss the smell of cut hay, I miss the morning","You can plant potatoes, they're easy, they don't need much, I'll show you"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Farm? Man, I'm from the city, I wouldn't know a tomato from a turnip","We hear there's a farm near the county line, growing tomatoes, I'd love one","Growing food is smart, if you've got time, we don't"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Farms? Not interested in your garden!"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"My uncle had a little garden, collards and tomatoes, I helped him sometimes, good times"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Farm out past the quarry took in some bikers, no trouble, they fed us a week","Growing food takes time, {g:brother|sister}, and nobody's giving us time","Farms are the future, if there's a future"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Farms? Not for you!"}},
{"ASK_FARM","reg=club|st=friendly",{"We had a community garden in the old clubhouse lot, until the dead tore it up"}},
