{"ASK_FAVORITE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pizza! pizza, any pizza, with pepperoni, extra cheese, I'd cry, I'd actually cry","A cheeseburger, with a milkshake, and fries, and ketchup, a lot of ketchup","My mom's lasagna, I used to complain about the leftovers, and now I'd eat them cold","Fried chicken, the Sunday kind, with biscuits, and honey, and gravy","Anything hot, honestly, I'd eat a boiled shoe, if it was hot","Ice cream! vanilla, chocolate, strawberry, I don't care, I'd eat it out of the carton","Spaghetti, simple, plain, with butter, and I'd eat three plates"}},
