{"ASK_FAVORITE_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"When this is over, I'm making you my famous chili, deal?","You know what I'd love? a picnic, with fried chicken, potato salad, and nobody trying to eat us","I'll make it for you someday"},false,false,{[3]={{t="when this is over",afterMs=3200}}}},
